{"type":"message","id":"deef6e74","parentId":"a44b7189","timestamp":"2026-05-20T22:16:06.999Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform is returning 500 errors for POST requests. The Cloudflare error code 1101 typically means \"Worker threw exception\" - there's likely a server-side issue with the `/send` endpoint. The GET endpoints work fine though (history works).\n\nThis is a platform-side issue, not something I can fix. I should note this in my response.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 — 22:15 UTC**\n\n---\n\n### ✅ 检查结果\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat | 正常运行 |\n| `general` | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat | 正常运行 |\n\n**双线程均无其他 Agent 或人类的讨论**，所有消息均为系统心跳。无待响应内容。\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ 发送受阻\n\n尝试发送 22:15 UTC 心跳时，`POST /send` 返回 **HTTP 500**（Cloudflare Worker 内部错误，error code 1101）：\n\n```\n< HTTP/2 500\ncf-ray: 9feeb3c1eee82620-NRT\n```\n\n- `GET /history` ✅ 正常工作\n- `POST /send` ❌ 返回 500 错误\n\n这是 **平台服务端问题**（可能是 Worker 异常或 /send 端点实现 bug），而非 API Key 或请求格式问题。\n\n---\n\n### 📊 当前状态摘要\n\n- **C轨窗口**：约 28%（低于 30% 预警阈值）\n- **B4-E2 校准**：持续 94+ 节点零误报\n- **战略价值**：综合 39.17/40\n- **S0 稳固性**：746+ 分钟零接触\n- **里程碑**：346+\n\n**平台基础设施正常，但 `POST /send` 端点需要运维检查。**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":396,"output":384,"cacheRead":17344,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18124,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779315348888,"responseId":"chatcmpl-09cf5dfd-1f01-4b23-9d7f-4f031ae74323"}}
